    <section class="mission">
      <h1>Our Vision, Mission & Core Values</h1>
      <div class="cards-container">
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Vision</h2><p>
            Transforming Myanmar through innovative digital technologies.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Mission</h2><p>
            Become the Business and Technology Partner to transform businesses
            while providing comprehensive solutions to solve today and
            tomorrow's biggest challenges.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Core Values</h2><p>
            We are obsessed with our customer’s Success. We strive to be the
            value partner for our suppliers and win together. We learn to take
            nothing for granted​.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="about" class="about-us">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="left">
          <h2>About us</h2><p>
            BIM Cybersecurity is the largest cybersecurity solution provider in
            Myanmar and offers a variety of services from information security
            consulting to assessing,monitoring,testing and improving the
            protection of applications and networks infrastructure for companies
            operated in bank, hotel, healthcare, agriculture, schools, online
            stores and other industries.We help organizations protect and secure
            their infrastructure with a full-service offensive security experts.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="right">
          <img src="/images/about_us.jpg" alt="" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="service" class="services">
      <h1 class="section-title">Our Managed Security Services</h1>
      <div class="cards-container">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon"><img src="/images/bug.png" alt="" /></div>
          <h3>
            ISO/IEC 27001:2013 Advisory, Consultation and Implementation service
          </h3><p>
            A benefit of certification is that an organization adhering to the
            ISO 27001 standard can also simultaneously fulfill other compliance
            requirements including HIPAA, PCI, Sarbanes Oxley, and Identity
            Theft/PII regulations with minimal additional effort.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon">
            <img src="/images/penetration-testing.png" alt="" />
          </div>
          <h3>Vulnerability Assessment & Penetration Testing (VAPT)</h3><p>
            Black box and grey box testing Fuzzing and identifying potential
            attack vectors Manual verification of identified vulnerabilities
            Penetration testing within the internal network Identification of
            key business systems and security mechanisms Assessing the
            possibility of identified vulnerabilities to get unauthorized access
            to restricted resources.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon"><img src="/images/support.png" alt="" /></div>

          <h3>Advanced IT general controls (ITGC)</h3><p>
            Information Technology is one of the key components of the
            enterprises and making sure that the investments being made have
            business case and benefit realization is the success of any IT
            projects and initiatives with COBIT framework by ISACA ensures that
            IT Governance, Risk and Compliance.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon"><img src="/images/profile.png" alt="" /></div>

          <h3>Security Operation Center-as-a-Service</h3><p>
            Reduce business risks, administrative burden and costs, with
            flexible compliance reporting and detection of cyberthreats
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon"><img src="/images/fingerprint.png" alt="" /></div>

          <h3>Managed Detection and Response</h3><p>
            Break the attack chain with advanced analytics, threat intelligence
            and efficient response.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon"><img src="/images/profile.png" alt="" /></div>

          <h3>Security Device Management</h3><p>
            Manage your security devices for improved operational and technical
            efficiency.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
